### Listar
GET http://localhost:8080/filmes
Accept: application/json

### Cadastrar
POST http://localhost:8080/filmes
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{"titulo": "Interestelar", "genero": "Ficcao cientifica", "ano": 2014}

### Buscar por ID
GET http://localhost:8080/filmes/1

### Filtrar
GET http://localhost:8080/filmes?genero=FICCAO CIENTIFICA

### Atualizar (todos os campos)
PUT http://localhost:8080/filmes/1
Content-Type: application/json

{"titulo": "Interestelar Atualizado", "genero": "Ficcao cientifica", "ano": 2014}

### Excluir
DELETE http://localhost:8080/filmes/1

### Inválido: 400
POST http://localhost:8080/filmes
Content-Type: application/json

{}
